Privacy Policy

Last updated: July 2026

Thank you for using Password Deriver.

Your privacy is our priority. Password Deriver is designed to generate passwords entirely on your device without collecting, storing, or transmitting your sensitive information.

Information We Collect

Password Deriver does not collect, store, or transmit:

Master passwords
Generated passwords
Service names or website names
Personal information
Email addresses
Device identifiers
Usage history

All password generation is performed locally on your device.

Offline Operation

Password Deriver is designed to work completely offline.

Your passwords are generated locally and are never sent to our servers or any third-party service.

Password Storage

Password Deriver does not store your passwords.

Every password is generated on demand using your master password and your selected settings.

If you enter the same information again, the same password will be generated.

Analytics

Password Deriver does not use analytics services to track your activity.

We do not collect usage statistics or behavioral data.

Advertising

The free version of Password Deriver may display advertisements provided by third-party advertising networks.

These advertising providers may collect limited technical information, such as advertising identifiers, in accordance with their own privacy policies.

Password Deriver itself does not access or share your master password, generated passwords, or service names with advertisers.

Third-Party Services

Depending on the version of the application, third-party services may include:

Google AdMob (Advertising)
Google Play Services

These services are governed by their own privacy policies.

Security

Your master password never leaves your device.

Generated passwords are created locally using secure cryptographic algorithms and are never transmitted or stored by Password Deriver.

Children's Privacy

Password Deriver is not intended for children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect any personal information from children.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time.

Any updates will be published on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.

